<!--
  Hindi translations.

  Written in the register people actually use for money in urban India rather than in formal
  Sanskritised Hindi: familiar English loanwords (बैंक, बजट, कार्ड, ईएमआई, यूपीआई) are kept because
  translating them into their Sanskrit equivalents would make the app harder to read, not easier.

  Only strings a user reads are translated. Keys that are placeholders for developer-supplied
  values fall back to the English file.
-->
